  "description": "Named synthetic one-target score and gate diagnostics for cbrn_protect_hospitals_and_utilities. ENG/state 16 is a fixture binding, not a live campaign target or complete national target pool. A population of 1000 yields source-calculated quoted values of 30 masks and 20 support under current constants; hospital PP is 10. Exact-alert cases explicitly supply those normal state quote variables as hypothetical registration output. Clean/contamination-only baseline cases omit them because the current dormant alert writer is the only active source; this keeps the existing missing-writer condition visible. The adapter reports AI willingness scores only and does not normalize them to a decision-selection probability.",
